; SuperFast_Gold_HighWin
; Gold (XAUUSD) M15 -> M1, trading ENABLED, 0.01 lots.
;
; Measured on 2025-09-25 to 2026-09-20: 61 trades, 91.8% correct, +0.15 R per trade, PF 2.80, worst streak 2
;
; Highest win rate found. A 0.25R target needs 80% just to break even, so it earns LESS per trade than the two above despite winning far more often.
;
; These values were chosen by searching 256 configurations on one symbol over one
; year. That selection was made by looking at the results, so the figures above are
; the best case, not an expectation. No out-of-sample test has been run on them.

